        "@value": "After a rigorous application process, Over A Rainbow has been selected to perform at the Azores Fringe Festival. 36 000 pictures of everyday, life, and love accumulate and flicker in rainbow order (ROYGBIV) over an interior monologue—where the artists attempt..."
