    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "I am extraordinarily grateful to have been selected to an Artist in Residence at both SPAM! (Italy) and Akropoditi Dance Centre (Greece).   The studios, cultures, and landscape combine to make it a luxury to be working on this new work “Over A Rainbow” where   36..."
