        "@value": "Over A Rainbow"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "I am extraordinarily grateful to have been selected to an Artist in Residence at both SPAM! (Italy) and Akropoditi Dance Centre (Greece).   The studios, cultures, and landscape combine to make it a luxury to be working on this new work “Over A Rainbow” where &nbsp; 36..."
      }
